{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/7\u670825\u65e5(3)(1)?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 When a cold snap froze the entire world, three survivors of vastly different temperaments burst into your life. You'll lead them through this frozen wasteland of an adventure! As zombie groans morph into mournful elegies and blizzards blur the line between good and evil... What awaits ahead - hope or conspiracy? And now, that fate-deciding dice burns hot between your fingers...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Apocalyptic Survival: A Rebellion Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leo (You)</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most insignificant warehouse clerk in Marina Bay, enduring workplace oppression in silence until the eve of apocalypse when you finally snapped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0&quot;No pay? Then I'll empty the warehouse as compensation!&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Who would've thought this decision would become your key to survival in the frozen apocalypse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c<strong>Triple Fates: Intertwined Destinies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/ca7442f9d0e08d8f862efa7400628834.poster.avif?t=1760592519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/ca7442f9d0e08d8f862efa7400628834.webm?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/ca7442f9d0e08d8f862efa7400628834.mp4?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong><i>&quot;Either we run together... or I'll die first!&quot;</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Molly</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archery major, sophomore at Marina Bay Sports Academy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your buddy Sam\u2019s younger sister. After her brother was severely injured by debt-collecting gangsters, she had no choice but to hide in your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough and brave, but rebellious. Might just become your strongest ally in critical moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d5370aa3f9583da7bb5f0807dd00ab74.poster.avif?t=1760592519\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d5370aa3f9583da7bb5f0807dd00ab74.webm?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d5370aa3f9583da7bb5f0807dd00ab74.mp4?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Stop obsessing over that time I saved you incidentally. You're just a stray dog by the roadside.&quot;</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Erlinda</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little is known except her employment at Dorun - the world's top biotech conglomerate </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her motives remain inscrutable, though she once saved your life by chance </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly does she know about this crisis...?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.poster.avif?t=1760592519\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.webm?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.mp4?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>&quot;Today's special... Mutant Potato Pie!&quot;</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reina</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diligent pastry chef operating a food truck at Marina Bay's beach plaza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Her cheerful sales pitches echo daily, yet few customers ever stop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Always grinning oddly at strangers... best not to engage...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u88c5\u9970\u5206\u5272\u7ebf.png?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Facing the Apocalypse's Trials - Can You Last Till Dawn?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biting Cold</strong>: Your tropical hometown Marina Bay has inexplicably plunged below zero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Zombie Onslaught</strong>: The cold slows them down... but you too... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humanity Test</strong>: Former neighbors may prove deadlier than the undead!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u300aSUBZERO\u300b\u00a0</i>is a live-action interactive movie game where critical choices or dice rolls determine the story's course.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decisions affect relationships, unlocking branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategically nurture bonds and manage dice modifiers to reach wildly different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/03aaacd7dcc0721004be8eb90ee144f3.avif?t=1760592519\" width=648 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The Dice Decides Your Fate! Try Your Luck! </strong></i><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>--Your next roll could be your final breath!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Choose Wisely!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices impact both affinity AND die modifiers (bonus/penalty)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/Debuff2.png?t=1760592519\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 [Restrain rage, endure insults!] \u2192 [Remain composed; Molly Affinity +1] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/Buff2.png?t=1760592519\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 [Enough! Punch his lights out!] \u2192 [Let loose; Dice Roll +2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Soon, every choice you make... will become ice picks stabbing your conscience</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u88c5\u9970\u5206\u5272\u7ebf.png?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Ultimate Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50fps cinematic camera work for fluid action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective for immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Less static dialogue - your character stays in motion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u6218\u6597(1)?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Release date</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=