ment at Dorun - the world's top biotech conglomerate </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her motives remain inscrutable, though she once saved your life by chance </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What exactly does she know about this crisis...?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.poster.avif?t=1760592519\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.webm?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/d95b1d5e82399e0e7711447f9ac8497e.mp4?t=1760592519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>&quot;Today's special... Mutant Potato Pie!&quot;</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reina</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diligent pastry chef operating a food truck at Marina Bay's beach plaza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Her cheerful sales pitches echo daily, yet few customers ever stop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Always grinning oddly at strangers... best not to engage...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u88c5\u9970\u5206\u5272\u7ebf.png?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Facing the Apocalypse's Trials - Can You Last Till Dawn?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biting Cold</strong>: Your tropical hometown Marina Bay has inexplicably plunged below zero!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Zombie Onslaught</strong>: The cold slows them down... but you too... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humanity Test</strong>: Former neighbors may prove deadlier than the undead!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u300aSUBZERO\u300b\u00a0</i>is a live-action interactive movie game where critical choices or dice rolls determine the story's course.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Decisions affect relationships, unlocking branching narratives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategically nurture bonds and manage dice modifiers to reach wildly different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/03aaacd7dcc0721004be8eb90ee144f3.avif?t=1760592519\" width=648 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0The Dice Decides Your Fate! Try Your Luck! </strong></i><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>--Your next roll could be your final breath!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Choose Wisely!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices impact both affinity AND die modifiers (bonus/penalty)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/Debuff2.png?t=1760592519\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 [Restrain rage, endure insults!] \u2192 [Remain composed; Molly Affinity +1] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/Buff2.png?t=1760592519\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 [Enough! Punch his lights out!] \u2192 [Let loose; Dice Roll +2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Soon, every choice you make... will become ice picks stabbing your conscience</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u88c5\u9970\u5206\u5272\u7ebf.png?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Ultimate Combat Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50fps cinematic camera work for fluid action </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective for immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Less static dialogue - your character stays in motion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u6218\u6597(1)?t=1760592519\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u258c <strong>Release date</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/04ebb8d511d621ece6718a31e69d5321.avif?t=1760592519\" width=880 height=363 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/extras/\u88c5\u9970\u5206\u5272\u7ebf.png?t=1760592519\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 <strong><i>&quot;In SUBZERO, trust is rarer than bullets - but who will you give it to?&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Joy Media Limited"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3711170","name":"SubZero"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712450/b00c0cccf1579d1ee1267296e7ad02d9654afb0b/header.jpg?t=1760592519","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3712450/86121727/a5217cbe5ffbec152f09a7e1378e48c10af163e7/1753428993/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760415322","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3712450/86121727/a5217cbe5ffbec152f09a7e1378e48c10af163e7/1753428993/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760415322","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3712450/86121727/a5217cbe5ffbec152f09a7e1378e48c10af163e7/1753428993/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760415322","id":257151835,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151835/movie480.mp4?t=1760415322","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151835/movie_max.mp4?t=1760415322"},"name":"1\u5206\u949f\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247\u4e2d\u6587","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151835/0638cd2761357923db95b431fd23080ba792277e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760415322","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c